Aye Shaheed-e-jafa Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
kya Sitam Hogaya Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
<br>
1. Zeher Angoor Me Haaye Mamoon Ne<br>
<br>
aap Ko Dediya Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Khaak Par Lot-te Hain Jigar Thaam Ke<br>
<br>
khake Ke Zehr-e-dagha Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Peet-te Nikle Hain Apna Seena-o-sar<br>
<br>
qabr Se Murtaza Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Bagh-e-jannat Se Khairunnisa Aagayin<br>
<br>
karti Aah-o-buka Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Dekhiye Uthke Yasrab Se Milne Tumhe<br>
<br>
aayi Hai Masooma Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Aapke Gham Me Rote Hain Sar Peet Ke<br>
<br>
aaj Ahl-e-aza Ya Imam-e-raza<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Ek Qayamath Hai Momin Khurasaan Me<br>
<br>
rote Hain Mustafa Ya Imam-e-raza